  "description": "Chae Da-On, a girl group member who shot to stardom with a single cute plea “Tell me I’m your favorite!” only to fall from grace due to a scandal caused by a single mistake! She travels back in time, determined to save Seol Ji-Ho, who was also caught up in the scandal... but will she succeed?\n\nA chaotic romance between Da-On, who’s become as cold as ice, and Ji-Ho, who keeps getting rejected without even knowing why. \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
